    {
      "key": "96341c57-6e3a-4f05-96c2-e668bef6e7f4",
      "position": 7,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa fa-check-square-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Do This:** Direct students to Lesson 11, Level 12 to complete the Final Reflection in their Interactive Data Dashboard Project. Explain that this final step helps them consolidate what they learned about designing clear dashboards, making filtering choices fair and transparent, supporting user control, and using AI intentionally. Emphasize that their answers should include specific examples from their own dashboards.\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-refresh\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Circulate:** As students write, encourage them to reference concrete moments from their project:\n* a design or code decision that changed from the original plan\n* a filter, label, or Reset/Undo choice that improved fairness, visibility, or user control\n* how they evaluated, modified, or rejected AI suggestions\n\nProbe with questions like:\n* What changed in your dashboard between your first plan and your final version?\n* How do your filters, labels, or Reset/Undo choices help users understand and control what they see?\n* How did AI help with planning, coding, or debugging?\n\nIf students finish early, prompt them to revisit the rubric or add more specific examples from their dashboard.\n",
        "tips": [
          {
            "type": "assessmentOpportunity",
            "markdown": "You can use the Final Reflection as assessment evidence for Process, Iteration, and Code/UI Quality.\n\nThe Final Reflection also provides evidence for Ethical Reasoning: Transparency & Fairness, since students explain how their filters, labels, and Reset/Undo choices affect visibility and user control.\nCode excerpts and screenshots from Milestones 2–4 can serve as evidence for Schema & Dataset Design, Dynamic Rendering with Loops, and Algorithmic Features, depending on what students choose to showcase and annotate.\n"
          }
        ]
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "96341c57-6e3a-4f05-96c2-e668bef6e7f4",
        "lesson_activity.key": "082613f8-13c5-4c65-a9f1-0f1d4d63e4a5"
      }
    },
